  version            Show the CLI and each deploy-layer version

${C_BOLD}Exit codes${C_RESET}
  0 success   1 runtime failure   2 usage error   3 prerequisites unmet   10 check found a new version

${C_BOLD}Common examples${C_RESET}
  ${CLI_NAME} doctor                             # pre-deploy physical
  ${CLI_NAME} init --version 1.811.1             # fresh deploy at a pinned version
  ${CLI_NAME} backup --full                      # take a full snapshot now
  ${CLI_NAME} drill                              # verify the latest snapshot really restores
  ${CLI_NAME} upgrade                            # upgrade to the upstream latest
  ${CLI_NAME} logs windmill_server -f            # follow the server logs
  ${CLI_NAME} destroy --all --yes                # wipe everything (incl. backups and images)

${C_DIM}Single file, no external dependencies; config templates are embedded, so deleting the deploy dir does not affect this CLI.${C_RESET}
HELP
}

