${C_BOLD}Options${C_RESET}
  --version X.Y.Z   Target version (default: query the upstream latest release)
  --port N          External HTTP port (default 80)
  --ghcr-mirror URL ghcr registry mirror (strongly recommended in China). Direct ghcr.io measures ~0.5MB/s;
                    a fresh deploy pulls ~6GiB (>1 hour); https://ghcr.nju.edu.cn measures ~60MB/s
  --hub-mirror URL  docker.io registry mirror (postgres). If the daemon's registry-mirrors
                    contain black-hole entries, docker pull hangs silently; this bypasses them;
                    e.g. https://docker.1ms.run
  --no-harden       Skip hardening (do not set Base URL or change the default admin password)
  --no-systemd      Skip installing the systemd scheduled tasks
  --force           Overwrite the config when the target dir already has a deploy

${C_BOLD}Flow${C_RESET}
  Generate config -> random DB password -> validate -> pull images -> staged startup -> health check
  -> set Base URL + rotate admin password -> install scheduled tasks -> print credentials

${C_BOLD}Examples${C_RESET}
